<title>USA: Conseco completes American Travellers deal.</title>
<headline>Conseco completes American Travellers deal.</headline>
<dateline>CARMEL, Ind. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conseco Inc said Tuesday it completed its merger with American Travellers Corp.</p>
<p>As part of the merger, American Travellers' common stock was converted into the right to receive 0.5836 of a share of Conseco common stock.</p>
<p>Conseco is a leading provider of supplemental health insurance, retirement annuities and universal life insurance.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
